# A part of the programs unit_s7_part_root_field.lm2, unit_walk_s7_part_root_field.lm2,
# unit_s7_part_root_hidden.lm2 and unit_s7_part_callable_field.lm2 (steps/table-receiver.md §10).  Its root
# declares k, 5 -- a field of the part's root, a Structure of the program with no name, built with its
# initializer -- and holds the statement `k: 7U`, the body of that root's procedure, which nothing executes.
# get reads k; peek calls get (a call through the program's unit); bump writes k; viaNode reads it as node\k.
size_t: k 5U
k: 7U
fn: get () size_t
return: k
fn: peek () size_t
return: get()
fn: bump () size_t
    k: k + 1U
    return: k
fn: viaNode () size_t
    size_t: r 0U
    r: node\k
    return: r
